Notes about the conversion from sql to test requests:
* General
  * I did not invent values for unused elements, i.e. only entered values for 
    elements that are needed/imported by LOGON. Future changes in the implementation
    may need to enrich existing data.      

* ADN73031. ADN Kies und Beton Regli AG (old pk -31447)
  * SAP_ID was set to ADN73031 and SAP_IFC_ID was set to ADM0073031 which would 
    not occur if the BP would have been received by SAP, as the id is the leading 
    zeroes trimmed sap_ifc_id. New value of SAP_IFC_ID = "ADN73031" 
  * Updated street from 'Bahnhofstrasse' to 'Bahnhofstrasse 33'
  * CHROMAT_REDUCTION_MONTHS was set to 2, but there is no possibility to send that
    in the BP interface (KATR1 is not used anymore, but hardcoded to -1)
  * Company code relation - stored in tlgns_sap_bp_company_code - was not present,
    now assigned bp to AD02
    
* ADN1208869, ADN Betonwerk Zumdorf (old pk -1470)
  * CHROMAT_REDUCTION_MONTHS was set to 2, but there is no possibility to send that
    in the BP interface (KATR1 is not used anymore, but hardcoded to -1)
  * Company code relation - stored in tlgns_sap_bp_company_code - was not present,
    now assigned bp to AD02
  
* ADN72824, HG COMMERCIALE Luzern (old pk -31352)
  * SAP_IFC_ID was set to 'ADN0072824' and SAP_ID to 'ADN72824', a combination which is
    not possible with current SAP import. Now both ids are set to 'ADN72824'
  * Company code relation - stored in tlgns_sap_bp_company_code - was not present,
    now assigned bp to AD02